      "options": {
        "mode": "html",
        "content": "<div style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.6\">\n<p><b>Reading the combined chart.</b> Hours of sleep, minutes of exercise and steps don't share a scale, so each line\nshows <b>where that day ranks among your own days</b> on screen: 100 is your highest, 0 your lowest, and the grey\nline at 50 is a typical day. Ranking puts a long night and a big exercise day on the same footing, however different\nthe units, and one extreme day can't flatten the rest. Each date pairs\n<b style=\"color:#5c7cfa\">the night that ended that morning</b> with that day's\n<b style=\"color:#2f9e44\">exercise</b> and <b style=\"color:#e8590c\">steps</b>: the day after the night.</p>\n<p>Peaks and dips that line up are worth a look, not proof: over a few weeks, lines can match by chance.</p></div>"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Sleep and the next day's activity, ranked against your own days",
      "description": "Each series as its percentile rank over the selected range: 100 = your highest day, 50 = typical, 0 = lowest.",
      "datasource": {
        "uid": "healthlog-db"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "uid": "healthlog-db"
          },
          "rawQuery": true,
          "editorMode": "code",
          "rawSql": "WITH s AS (\n  SELECT sleep_date AS day, total_sleep_h AS v FROM sleep_nightly WHERE $__timeFilter((sleep_date::timestamp AT TIME ZONE '$tz'))\n), e AS (\n  SELECT day, sum AS v FROM daily_metrics WHERE metric = 'apple_exercise_time' AND $__timeFilter((day::timestamp AT TIME ZONE '$tz'))\n), st AS (\n  SELECT day, sum AS v FROM daily_metrics WHERE metric = 'step_count' AND $__timeFilter((day::timestamp AT TIME ZONE '$tz'))\n), days AS (SELECT day FROM s UNION SELECT day FROM e UNION SELECT day FROM st)\nSELECT (day::timestamp AT TIME ZONE '$tz') AS time,\n  s.r AS \"Sleep (the night before)\", e.r AS \"Exercise\", st.r AS \"Steps\"\nFROM days\n  LEFT JOIN (SELECT day, 100 * percent_rank() OVER (ORDER BY v) AS r FROM s) s USING (day)\n  LEFT JOIN (SELECT day, 100 * percent_rank() OVER (ORDER BY v) AS r FROM e) e USING (day)\n  LEFT JOIN (SELECT day, 100 * percent_rank() OVER (ORDER BY v) AS r FROM st) st USING (day)\nORDER BY day",
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "Not reported by your devices in this range",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "showPoints": "always",
            "pointSize": 5,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line+area"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "transparent",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "#adb5bd",
                "value": 50
              }
            ]
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Sleep (the night before)"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#5c7cfa"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.lineWidth",
                "value": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Exercise"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#2f9e44"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Steps"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#e8590c"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
